ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors is an office suite with editors for text
documents, spreadsheets, presentations, fillable forms and PDF files,
highly compatible with the Microsoft Office formats (DOCX, XLSX, PPTX)
and also working with OpenDocument, RTF, TXT, CSV and others.

The editors can work with local files or connect to cloud platforms such
as ONLYOFFICE DocSpace, Nextcloud, ownCloud and Seafile to collaborate
on documents.

This port builds the editors natively and uses the Chromium Embedded
Framework from www/cef.
